WEBVTT

00:05:28.434 --> 00:05:32.991
Now, as a devout Muslim,
he refused alcohol,

00:05:32.991 --> 00:05:35.188
didn't touch the stuff.

00:05:35.188 --> 00:05:40.215
Then he learned that not selling it
would slash his pay.

00:05:40.215 --> 00:05:44.006
So he reasoned, like a budding 
American pragmatist,

00:05:44.006 --> 00:05:48.138
"Well, God wouldn't want me
to starve, would he?"

00:05:48.138 --> 00:05:51.406
And before long, in some months, 
Raisuddin was that Olive Garden's

00:05:51.406 --> 00:05:55.477
highest grossing alcohol pusher.

00:05:55.477 --> 00:05:59.364
He found a man who taught him
database administration.

00:05:59.364 --> 00:06:01.486
He got part-time I.T. gigs.